{
  "name": "badge",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "徽章 Badge",
  "description": "用紧凑的标签展示状态、分类或简短元数据。",
  "import": "import { Badge, badgeVariants } from \"@/components/ui/badge\"",
  "exports": [
    "Badge",
    "badgeVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "BadgeProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "pnpm dlx @wui-design/cli@latest add @wui/badge",
    "shadcn": "pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://ui.wzx.wang/r/badge.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "radix-ui",
      "class-variance-authority"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"secondary\" | \"destructive\" | \"outline\" | \"success\" | \"warning\" | \"info\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "secondary",
        "destructive",
        "outline",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "info"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Visual treatment of the badge."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"sm\" | \"lg\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "sm",
        "lg"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Height and horizontal padding preset."
    },
    {
      "name": "asChild",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean",
      "defaultValue": "false",
      "description": "Render as the single child element via Radix Slot."
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Badge` 适合展示状态、分类、版本和其他短文本。语义色使用主题中的 `info`、`success`、`warning` 与 `destructive` token；仅表达分类而非状态时，优先使用 `default`、`secondary` 或 `outline`。\n\n通过 `asChild` 可以把样式合并到链接等单个子元素上，同时保留子元素原有语义。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "badge-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/badge.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/docs/components/badge",
  "sourceUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/r/badge.json"
}
